{'symbol': 'UNM', 'date': '2021-07-16 16:15:00', 'title': 'UNUM GROUP DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE OF ITS COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'CHATTANOOGA, TENN., JULY 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EFFECTIVE JULY 16, 2021, THE UNUM GROUP (NYSE:UNM) BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID AUGUST 20, 2021, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JULY 30, 2021.'}